                   </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-level-up-alt\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Installation &amp; Relocation</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">Correct installation prevents premature machine aging. Our <strong>Intec AC installation Vadodara</strong> team focuses on perfect leveling for drainage and high-grade copper flaring to prevent future gas leaks. We also provide safe uninstallation and shifting across the city.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹700</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden bg-[#1A202C] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-industry text-6xl text-[#D4AF37] opacity-80 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class